   "strength": "strong",
   "segment_id": "s1"
  },
  {
   "id": "p3",
   "t": 32.546,
   "phrase": "here",
   "sentence": "For example, if I want to plot a particular function here, how do I set the amplitude bars to produce it?",
   "strength": "weak",
   "segment_id": "s1"
  },
  {
   "id": "p4",
   "t": 52.61,
   "phrase": "that function",
   "sentence": "All of the information that function carries is contained in half a period.",
   "strength": "strong",
   "segment_id": "s2"
  },
  {
   "id": "p5",
   "t": 63.954,
   "phrase": "these points",
   "sentence": "We use the values of these points as the inputs for the machine.",
   "strength": "strong",
   "segment_id": "s2"
  },
  {
   "id": "p6",
   "t": 78.594,
   "phrase": "look at",
